    "detailed_description": "Get ready for a fresh new experience with <strong>Sunstone War</strong>, an Action game with tower defense element where you can carry <strong>EVERYTHING</strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/0f2ef2b3fcda47314246683463d5e285.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/0f2ef2b3fcda47314246683463d5e285.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/0f2ef2b3fcda47314246683463d5e285.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Unprecedented Freedom</h2>Enjoy a refreshing twist to traditional Tower Defense gameplay by granting you the freedom to carry <strong>EVERYTHING!</strong> \u2013 from towers to obstacles and even enemies!<br>Craft impenetrable defenses by strategically relocating towers to create a barrier, or scatter approaching enemies by picking them up and hurling them into the distance.<br>With the ability to shape the battlefield to your advantage, every level becomes an opportunity to unleash your creativity and strategic prowess.<br>With multiple ways to complete levels, you'll need to discover your own unique playstyle to conquer the challenges ahead!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/8e9a5383c15f2d2a85a0df389cf2d613.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/8e9a5383c15f2d2a85a0df389cf2d613.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/8e9a5383c15f2d2a85a0df389cf2d613.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Multiple Challenges</h2>As you face off against a myriad of foes, each presents a unique challenge that will test your skills and wit. From lightning-fast adversaries to those who summon reinforcements, and even elusive invisible foes, you'll encounter a diverse array of obstacles that demand real-time strategizing.<br>With countless approaches to level completion, mastering your own style of gameplay is key to victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/5c1f1724ef319a4d80591e040edbd9c5.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/5c1f1724ef319a4d80591e040edbd9c5.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/5c1f1724ef319a4d80591e040edbd9c5.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades and Progression</h2>To aid you in your quest, use an upgrade system to continually enhance your abilities, including speed, endurance, and tower power!<br>Uncover two game-changing powers capable of shifting the tide of battle in your favor.<br>As you venture through 3 distinct biomes, each presenting its own set of challenges, items and opportunities, experiment with diverse strategies to find your own playstyle!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/d06367c15447b87cbcdcc64006ee4420.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/d06367c15447b87cbcdcc64006ee4420.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/d06367c15447b87cbcdcc64006ee4420.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Whether you prefer tactical finesse or brute force, Sunstone War empowers every player to forge their unique path to victory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/e05a212596a9f06c471519cef5541efe.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/e05a212596a9f06c471519cef5541efe.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/e05a212596a9f06c471519cef5541efe.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><br><strong>Included in Sunstone War:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5-8 hours of play time.<br></li><li> A &quot;busy&quot; tower defense where you will need to be active to win.<br></li><li> 60+ challenging levels, each testing your tactical prowess.</li></ul><br><strong>NOT included in Sunstone War:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Static and Classic Tower Defense mechanics<br></li><li> Infinite replayability<br><br><strong>Get ready to embark on an epic journey filled with strategic depth, thrilling action, and the relentless pursuit of victory in Sunstone War!</strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Get ready for a fresh new experience with <strong>Sunstone War</strong>, an Action game with tower defense element where you can carry <strong>EVERYTHING</strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/0f2ef2b3fcda47314246683463d5e285.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/0f2ef2b3fcda47314246683463d5e285.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/0f2ef2b3fcda47314246683463d5e285.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Unprecedented Freedom</h2>Enjoy a refreshing twist to traditional Tower Defense gameplay by granting you the freedom to carry <strong>EVERYTHING!</strong> \u2013 from towers to obstacles and even enemies!<br>Craft impenetrable defenses by strategically relocating towers to create a barrier, or scatter approaching enemies by picking them up and hurling them into the distance.<br>With the ability to shape the battlefield to your advantage, every level becomes an opportunity to unleash your creativity and strategic prowess.<br>With multiple ways to complete levels, you'll need to discover your own unique playstyle to conquer the challenges ahead!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/8e9a5383c15f2d2a85a0df389cf2d613.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/8e9a5383c15f2d2a85a0df389cf2d613.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/8e9a5383c15f2d2a85a0df389cf2d613.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Multiple Challenges</h2>As you face off against a myriad of foes, each presents a unique challenge that will test your skills and wit. From lightning-fast adversaries to those who summon reinforcements, and even elusive invisible foes, you'll encounter a diverse array of obstacles that demand real-time strategizing.<br>With countless approaches to level completion, mastering your own style of gameplay is key to victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/5c1f1724ef319a4d80591e040edbd9c5.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/5c1f1724ef319a4d80591e040edbd9c5.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/5c1f1724ef319a4d80591e040edbd9c5.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades and Progression</h2>To aid you in your quest, use an upgrade system to continually enhance your abilities, including speed, endurance, and tower power!<br>Uncover two game-changing powers capable of shifting the tide of battle in your favor.<br>As you venture through 3 distinct biomes, each presenting its own set of challenges, items and opportunities, experiment with diverse strategies to find your own playstyle!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/d06367c15447b87cbcdcc64006ee4420.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/d06367c15447b87cbcdcc64006ee4420.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/d06367c15447b87cbcdcc64006ee4420.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Whether you prefer tactical finesse or brute force, Sunstone War empowers every player to forge their unique path to victory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/e05a212596a9f06c471519cef5541efe.poster.avif?t=1733914124\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/e05a212596a9f06c471519cef5541efe.webm?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535560/extras/e05a212596a9f06c471519cef5541efe.mp4?t=1733914124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><br><strong>Included in Sunstone War:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5-8 hours of play time.<br></li><li> A &quot;busy&quot; tower defense where you will need to be active to win.<br></li><li> 60+ challenging levels, each testing your tactical prowess.</li></ul><br><strong>NOT included in Sunstone War:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Static and Classic Tower Defense mechanics<br></li><li> Infinite replayability<br><br><strong>Get ready to embark on an epic journey filled with strategic depth, thrilling action, and the relentless pursuit of victory in Sunstone War!</strong></li></ul>",
